category: Libs
requires: cygwin libbabeltrace2_0 libglib2.0_0
sdesc: "Open-source trace manipulation toolkit (utilities)"
ldesc: "Babeltrace 2 is also the reference parser implementation of the Common Trace
Format (CTF), a very versatile trace format followed by various tracers and
tools such as LTTng and barectf. The Babeltrace 2 library and its Python
bindings can read and write CTF traces."

